  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Country support to the enhancement of the Nationally Determined Contribution in the AFOLU sector - Technical Assistance Fund (TAF), on behalf of the NDC Partnership Climate Action Enhancement Package (CAEP)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Under the Climate Action Enhancement Package (CAEP) initiative of the NDC Partnership, countries have improved tools and strategies to reduce their emission and improve adaptation in the AFOLU sector by addressing existing gaps in the AFOLU components and develop more ambitious Nationally Determined Contributions.</narrative>
  </description>
